      id: 'risk_notification_message'
      doc: 'Firms configured to use Risk Protection Monitoring will receive User Notification communicating the status of Risk checks. Field Event Type is used to determine the reason for the notification. The following message will be used to disseminate all Emerald Risk Protection Monitor (RPM) related notifications. Sequenced and UnSequenced Pkt based on Event Type: solicited event types (T, R, W, D, A, P, U) are Sequenced messages at the SesM protocol level and recoverable; unsolicited (S) are Unsequenced and not recoverable.'
